Focuses on estimating LLM usage and API costs before building an application.
Calculates input tokens, output tokens and total token consumption.
Estimates daily and monthly API expenses.
Checks RPM (Requests Per Minute) and TPM (Tokens Per Minute) limits.
Applies a safety margin to account for unexpected usage.
Uses Python to generate a budget report and automated tests to verify calculations.

Output: A budget report displaying estimated costs, token usage, capacity checks and a final GO/NO-GO recommendation
